WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,470
Ogawa, if you don’t do this, can you think of a way?

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:04,470
Xiaochuan can't live without his father

3
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:05,470
You and I must only recognize you as a solitary eye

4
00:00:05,470 --> 00:00:06,470
I used to make things difficult in every possible way

5
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:07,470
Everything feels natural

6
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:08,470
Death is imminent now

7
00:00:08,470 --> 00:00:09,470
It makes me miss my old love

8
00:00:09,470 --> 00:00:11,470
What a ridiculous urgency

9
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:12,470
What kind of things are you two?

10
00:00:12,470 --> 00:00:13,470
I dare say they are half of my parents.

11
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,470
Su Anwan

12
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:15,470
If you don't take action again

13
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:16,470
Are you so loyal to death?

14
00:00:16,470 --> 00:00:22,600
Wanwan, what do you want to do?

15
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,600
You are going to lose your conscience

16
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:25,600
Wanwan, what do you know?

17
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,200
You are not very powerful

18
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,200
Can crystal art be used?

19
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,200
Can't you give it a try?
